# Agent configuration. AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, .mcp.json and .claude/{settings.json,skills,hooks}
# are committed on purpose — they are project tooling. These two are per-machine and are not:
# settings.local.json holds absolute paths from whoever ran the session, and CLAUDE.local.md is
# personal preference. Committing either puts one contributor's laptop into everyone's config.
.claude/settings.local.json
